  "Do {@0} {@1} sa zmestí ${@2}\\,\\text{{@3}}$. {@4}": "{@1}的{@0}能装 ${@2}\\,\\text{{@3}}$。{@4}",
  "Doplň chýbajúce číslo: $\\square : {@0} = {@1}$": "填出缺少的数：$\\square : {@0} = {@1}$",
