  "{@0} uhla ${@1}^\\circ$ má rovnakú absolútnu hodnotu ako pri ${@2}^\\circ$, znamienko určí kvadrant. Vyber hodnotu.": "角 ${@1}^\\circ$ 的{@0}与 ${@2}^\\circ$ 处的绝对值相同，符号由象限决定。选出这个值。",
  "{@0} štyrikrát": "{@0} 四次",
  "{@0}$\\binom{{@1}}{{@2}} = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}} = {@5}$.": "{@0}$\\binom{{@1}}{{@2}} = \\frac{{@3}}{{@4}} = {@5}$。",
  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží medzi ${@2}^\\circ$ a ${@3}^\\circ$, teda v {@4} kvadrante.": "{@0}角 ${@1}^\\circ$ 在 ${@2}^\\circ$ 和 ${@3}^\\circ$ 之间，所以在第 {@4} 象限。",
  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží v {@2} kvadrante, kde je {@3} kladný. Hodnota je kladná.": "{@0}角 ${@1}^\\circ$ 在第 {@2} 象限，{@3}在那里为正。值是正的。",
  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží v {@2} kvadrante, kde je {@3} záporný. Hodnota je záporná.": "{@0}角 ${@1}^\\circ$ 在第 {@2} 象限，{@3}在那里为负。值是负的。",
  "{@0}Uhol ${@1}^\\circ$ leží v {@2} kvadrante, príslušný ostrý uhol je ${@3}^\\circ$ a {@4} je tu {@5}. Preto ${@6}\\,{@7} = {@8}{@9}\\,{@10}^\\circ = {@11}$.": "{@0}角 ${@1}^\\circ$ 在第 {@2} 象限，对应的锐角是 ${@3}^\\circ$，{@4}在这里为{@5}。所以 ${@6}\\,{@7} = {@8}{@9}\\,{@10}^\\circ = {@11}$。",
  "{@0}Zo sínusovej vety ${@1} = \\frac{a\\sin {@2}}{\\sin\\alpha} = \\frac{{@3}\\cdot\\sin {@4}^\\circ}{\\sin {@5}^\\circ} \\approx \\frac{{@6}\\cdot {@7}}{{@8}} \\approx {@9}$ cm.": "{@0}由正弦定理 ${@1} = \\frac{a\\sin {@2}}{\\sin\\alpha} = \\frac{{@3}\\cdot\\sin {@4}^\\circ}{\\sin {@5}^\\circ} \\approx \\frac{{@6}\\cdot {@7}}{{@8}} \\approx {@9}$ cm。",
