  "$f(x)=\\frac{2}{3}x^{3/2}$, teda $f'(x)=\\sqrt{x}$ a $\\sqrt{1+f'^2(x)}=\\sqrt{1+x}$. $\\ell=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@0}}\\sqrt{1+x}\\,dx=\\frac{2}{3}\\left[(1+x)^{3/2}\\right]_0^{{@1}}=\\frac{2}{3}\\left({@2}^{3/2}-1\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}({@3}-1)={@4}$.": "$f(x)=\\frac{2}{3}x^{3/2}$，因此 $f'(x)=\\sqrt{x}$，$\\sqrt{1+f'^2(x)}=\\sqrt{1+x}$。$\\ell=\\displaystyle\\int_0^{{@0}}\\sqrt{1+x}\\,dx=\\frac{2}{3}\\left[(1+x)^{3/2}\\right]_0^{{@1}}=\\frac{2}{3}\\left({@2}^{3/2}-1\\right)=\\frac{2}{3}({@3}-1)={@4}$。",
  "$f(x)={@0}\\left(1-\\frac{x^2}{2!}+\\frac{x^4}{4!}-\\cdots\\right)$, koeficient pri $x^{{@1}}$ je ${@2}\\frac{1}{{@3}!}$. Preto $f^{({@4})}(0)={@5}!\\cdot\\left({@6}\\frac{1}{{@7}!}\\right)={@8}$.": "$f(x)={@0}\\left(1-\\frac{x^2}{2!}+\\frac{x^4}{4!}-\\cdots\\right)$，$x^{{@1}}$ 的系数为 ${@2}\\frac{1}{{@3}!}$。因此 $f^{({@4})}(0)={@5}!\\cdot\\left({@6}\\frac{1}{{@7}!}\\right)={@8}$。",
  "$f(x)={@0}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{{@1}{@2}}{k!}$, koeficient pri $x^{{@3}}$ je {@4}. Keďže koeficient pri $x^n$ je $\\frac{f^{(n)}(0)}{n!}$, platí $f^{({@5})}(0)={@6}!\\cdot {@7}={@8}$.": "$f(x)={@0}\\sum_{k=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{{@1}{@2}}{k!}$，$x^{{@3}}$ 的系数为 {@4}。由于 $x^n$ 的系数是 $\\frac{f^{(n)}(0)}{n!}$，所以 $f^{({@5})}(0)={@6}!\\cdot {@7}={@8}$。",
  "$f({@0},{@1})={@2}+{@3}\\cdot {@4}={@5}$, vrstevnica je $x^2+{@6}y^2={@7}$, teda $\\dfrac{x^2}{{@8}}+\\dfrac{y^2}{{@9}}=1$. Poloos v smere osi $x$ je $\\sqrt{{@10}}={@11}$ (v smere osi $y$ je $\\sqrt{{@12}}$).": "$f({@0},{@1})={@2}+{@3}\\cdot {@4}={@5}$，等值线为 $x^2+{@6}y^2={@7}$，即 $\\dfrac{x^2}{{@8}}+\\dfrac{y^2}{{@9}}=1$。$x$ 轴方向的半轴为 $\\sqrt{{@10}}={@11}$（$y$ 轴方向的为 $\\sqrt{{@12}}$）。",
  "$m=\\iiint_V ({@0})\\,dV$. Pre každý člen použijeme Fubiniho vetu, napr. $\\iiint_V x\\,dV=\\frac{{@1}^2}{2}\\cdot {@2}\\cdot {@3}$; spolu $m=\\dfrac{{@4}\\cdot {@5}\\cdot {@6}}{2}\\,({@7})=\\frac{{@8}\\cdot {@9}}{2}={@10}$.": "$m=\\iiint_V ({@0})\\,dV$。对每一项用富比尼定理，例如 $\\iiint_V x\\,dV=\\frac{{@1}^2}{2}\\cdot {@2}\\cdot {@3}$；合计 $m=\\dfrac{{@4}\\cdot {@5}\\cdot {@6}}{2}\\,({@7})=\\frac{{@8}\\cdot {@9}}{2}={@10}$。",
  "$s_{{@0}}={@1}={@2}\\approx {@3}$. Podľa Leibnizovho odhadu sa od súčtu $\\ln 2\\approx 0{@4}693$ líši najviac o $\\frac{1}{{@5}}$.": "$s_{{@0}}={@1}={@2}\\approx {@3}$。由莱布尼茨估计，它与和 $\\ln 2\\approx 0{@4}693$ 之差至多为 $\\frac{1}{{@5}}$。",
  "$u=\\ln x$, $v'={@0}$, teda $u'=\\frac{1}{x}$, $v=\\frac{x^{{@1}}}{{@2}}$: $\\int {@3}\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^{{@4}}}{{@5}}\\ln x-\\int\\frac{{@6}}{{@7}}\\,dx=\\frac{x^{{@8}}}{{@9}}\\ln x-\\frac{x^{{@10}}}{{@11}}+C$.": "$u=\\ln x$，$v'={@0}$，因此 $u'=\\frac{1}{x}$，$v=\\frac{x^{{@1}}}{{@2}}$：$\\int {@3}\\ln x\\,dx=\\frac{x^{{@4}}}{{@5}}\\ln x-\\int\\frac{{@6}}{{@7}}\\,dx=\\frac{x^{{@8}}}{{@9}}\\ln x-\\frac{x^{{@10}}}{{@11}}+C$。",
  "$u=x$, $v'=\\cos {@0}x$, teda $u'=1$, $v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}\\sin {@2}x$: $\\int x\\cos {@3}x\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}\\sin {@5}x-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int\\sin {@7}x\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}\\sin {@9}x+\\frac{1}{{@10}}\\cos {@11}x+C$.": "$u=x$，$v'=\\cos {@0}x$，因此 $u'=1$，$v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}\\sin {@2}x$：$\\int x\\cos {@3}x\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}\\sin {@5}x-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int\\sin {@7}x\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}\\sin {@9}x+\\frac{1}{{@10}}\\cos {@11}x+C$。",
  "$u=x$, $v'=\\sin {@0}x$, teda $u'=1$, $v=-\\frac{1}{{@1}}\\cos {@2}x$: $\\int x\\sin {@3}x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{{@4}}\\cos {@5}x+\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int\\cos {@7}x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{{@8}}\\cos {@9}x+\\frac{1}{{@10}}\\sin {@11}x+C$.": "$u=x$，$v'=\\sin {@0}x$，因此 $u'=1$，$v=-\\frac{1}{{@1}}\\cos {@2}x$：$\\int x\\sin {@3}x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{{@4}}\\cos {@5}x+\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int\\cos {@7}x\\,dx=-\\frac{x}{{@8}}\\cos {@9}x+\\frac{1}{{@10}}\\sin {@11}x+C$。",
  "$u=x$, $v'={@0}$, teda $u'=1$, $v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}{@2}$: $\\int x\\,{@3}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}{@5}-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int {@7}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}{@9}-\\frac{1}{{@10}}{@11}+C$.": "$u=x$，$v'={@0}$，因此 $u'=1$，$v=\\frac{1}{{@1}}{@2}$：$\\int x\\,{@3}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@4}}{@5}-\\frac{1}{{@6}}\\int {@7}\\,dx=\\frac{x}{{@8}}{@9}-\\frac{1}{{@10}}{@11}+C$。",
  "$z_0=f({@0},{@1})={@2}$. {@3}. Rovina: $z={@4}$, po úprave $z={@5}$.": "$z_0=f({@0},{@1})={@2}$。{@3}。切平面：$z={@4}$，整理得 $z={@5}$。",
  "${@0}={@1}\\,\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\cdot {@2}^\\circ}$, takže rovnica má {@3} {@4} s absolútnou hodnotou $\\sqrt[{@5}]{{@6}}={@7}$ a s argumentmi $\\frac{{@8}^\\circ+k\\cdot 360^\\circ}{{@9}}$, $k=0,\\dots,{@10}$: ${@11}$.": "${@0}={@1}\\,\\mathrm{e}^{\\mathrm{i}\\cdot {@2}^\\circ}$，所以方程有 {@3} {@4}，模均为 $\\sqrt[{@5}]{{@6}}={@7}$，辐角为 $\\frac{{@8}^\\circ+k\\cdot 360^\\circ}{{@9}}$，$k=0,\\dots,{@10}$：${@11}$。",
  "$|R_n(x)|=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}^{\\xi}}{(n+1)!}|x|^{n+1}$ pre $\\xi$ medzi $0$ a $x$. {@0} Chceme ${@1}\\gt {@2}10^{{@3}}$. Pre $n={@4}$ je ľavá strana ${@5}$, pre $n={@6}$ už ${@7}$. Preto $n={@8}$.": "$|R_n(x)|=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}^{\\xi}}{(n+1)!}|x|^{n+1}$，其中 $\\xi$ 介于 $0$ 与 $x$ 之间。{@0} 要求 ${@1}\\gt {@2}10^{{@3}}$。当 $n={@4}$ 时左边为 ${@5}$，当 $n={@6}$ 时已经是 ${@7}$。因此 $n={@8}$。",
  "$|a_n|=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to 1$, nie je splnená nutná podmienka konvergencie.": "$|a_n|=\\frac{n}{n+1}\\to 1$，不满足收敛的必要条件。",
